271
00:44:05.200 --> 00:44:09.400
Nojah, see oligi see moment,
mis mulle tõesti noh.

272
00:44:11.739 --> 00:44:16.210
Haiget tegijat,
et ma ei häbene oma elust mitte

273
00:44:16.210 --> 00:44:19.650
