277
00:44:33.670 --> 00:44:38.860
Tasub ainult valele inimesele
kätkia.

278
00:44:38.960 --> 00:44:41.290
Ei noh, see selleks.

279
00:44:41.390 --> 00:44:43.770
Ega mina viha ei pea,
sellega on raske elada.

280
00:44:43.870 --> 00:44:45.930
Kohe läheb
ka nende televisioon sama rada,

281
00:44:46.030 --> 00:44:48.305
