348
00:53:30.280 --> 00:53:33.150
Kes sinus käinud?

349
00:53:33.250 --> 00:53:36.540
On nii kaugel käinud?

350
00:53:36.640 --> 00:53:38.740
Kui.

351
00:54:46.370 --> 00:54:48.670
Kes sind on?

352
00:54:50.300 --> 00:54:52.630
Nii palju näinud

353
00:54:52.730 --> 00:54:57.520
